-- claim the centre rather than sit still, knights and bishops are rewarded
-- for reaching advanced outposts aimed at the enemy king, rooks want open
-- lines, and the king's middlegame table still strongly favours shelter --
-- an engine that gets its own king hunted down is not "aggressive", it is
-- just losing.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
